.sp 
.SH Documentation
.sp 
.nf 
\f[CB]module\fR Make (T : \f[CB]sig\fR \.\.\. \f[CB]end\fR) : \f[CB]sig\fR \.\.\. \f[CB]end\fR
.fi 
.br 
.ti +2
This module shows how to achieve the effect without include functor, with an intermediate module T\.
.nf 
.sp 
\f[CB]module\fR T : \f[CB]sig\fR \.\.\. \f[CB]end\fR
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR t = T\.t
.sp 
\f[CB]type\fR included = Make(T)\.included
